### ==========================================
### 用户上下文测试 — User Context Test
### 路径前缀：/test/user-context
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### ------------------- 获取当前用户上下文 -------------------
### @name Get User Context Info
# 返回当前请求的用户上下文信息，用于调试 LoginContextHolder 状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/test/user-context/info HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- Demo 使用示例 -------------------
### @name Demo Usage
GET {{baseUrl}}/test/user-context/demo HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
